We factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any factors that they have in common.

$$
\require{cancel}
    \eqalign{
        \dfrac {6y + 2} {3xy + x} &= \dfrac {6y + 2} {x(3y + 1)} \[5pt] 
        &=\dfrac {2(3y + 1)} {x(3y + 1)} \[5pt] 
        &=\dfrac {2\cancel{(3y + 1)} } {x \cancel{(3y + 1)} } \[5pt] 
        &=\dfrac {2 } {x}
    }
$$
